BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2027-28-Q1@mtd-quarterly-deadlines.smallwright
DTSTAMP:20261114T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270807
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270808
SUMMARY:MTD quarterly update 2027-28 Q1 due
DESCRIPTION:MTD quarterly update 2027-28 Q1 due. Covers 2027-04-06 to 2027-
 07-05 (standard) or 2027-04-01 to 2027-06-30 (calendar). Who: People in MT
 D for Income Tax that year: qualifying income over £30\,000 in 2025-26 (p
 lus everyone already in). A late quarterly update earns a penalty point (o
 ne per deadline\, even with several businesses)\; at 4 points a £200 pena
 lty\, then £200 for each further missed deadline. Volunteers: no points f
 or late quarterly updates. Source: https://www.gov.uk/guidance/use-making-
 tax-digital-for-income-tax/send-quarterly-updates
URL:https://www.gov.uk/guidance/use-making-tax-digital-for-income-tax/send-
 quarterly-updates
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
